ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">&gt;</span></u><u style=\"text-underline: #000000 single\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">알림에서 다운로드 가능</span></u></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; WORD-BREAK: keep-all; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">ㅇ </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">추천권자</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\"> </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">: </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">중앙행정기관장</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">광역자치단체장</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">광역자치단체교육감</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">전문대학 이상의 학교장</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">체육단체 또는</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">체육관계 학술단체의 장</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">(</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">기관 당 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">2</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">인 이내 추천</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">)</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; WORD-BREAK: keep-all; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">ㅇ </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">후보자 심사</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\"> </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">: </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">체육분야 전문인사로 구성된 대한민국체육상 심사위원회 심사 선정</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; WORD-BREAK: keep-all; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">ㅇ </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">수상자 발표</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\"> </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">: 2014</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">년 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">10</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">월초</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">(</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">수상자 본인 및 수상자 추천기관에 개별 통보</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">)</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; WORD-BREAK: keep-all; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">ㅇ </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">시상계획</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\"> </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">: </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">제</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">52</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">회 대한민국체육상 시상식</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">*</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">에서 시상</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; WORD-BREAK: keep-all; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">* </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">시상식 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">: 2014. 10. 15(</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">수</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">) 11:00~13:00 / </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">롯데호텔 사파이어 볼룸</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">(3</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">층</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">)</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; WORD-BREAK: keep-all; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">ㅇ </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">기타사항</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\"> </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">: </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">제출된 서류는 반환되지 않으며 공적확인 등을 위해 추가서류 제출을 요구할 수 있음</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">. </span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; WORD-BREAK: keep-all; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">기타 자세한 사항은 문화체육관광부 체육정책과</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">(044-203-3120~3121)</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">로 문의하시기 바람</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">.</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; WORD-BREAK: keep-all; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">붙임 &nbsp;</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">1. </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">심판상 추천 공적조서 양식 1부.</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; WORD-BREAK: keep-all; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 2. </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">체육인의 장한 어버이상 후보자 추천서 양식 주요내용 1부.&nbsp; 끝.</span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
